helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Типизированный скелет входа хелпера для изолированной проверки архитектуры.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    if len(args) < 2:\\n        return 2\\n    attempt_id, port_text = args[:2]\\n    if not attempt_id or not port_text.isdecimal():\\n        return 2\\n    return 0\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    if len(sys.argv) > 1 and sys.argv[1] == \\\"--serve-helper\\\":\\n        raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:]))\\n    raise SystemExit(main())\\n\",\n      \"synthetic_newfile_source\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Изолированная типизированная заглушка нового файла; не продуктовый тест.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n      \"reproducibility_note\": \"Temporary git baseline holds exact copied source/tests as origin/dev; no root __init__.py. Existing repo ruff.toml and bridge pyproject.toml copied unchanged. Only documented CATALOG_SOURCE/setter/None guards/helper CLI skeleton mutations, closed range formatting and synthetic docstring-only new test. Exact stored VER004.command evaluated unchanged by sh from temp repo root; output and command_sha256 below. All temp directories removed before handoff.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EVD-078\",\n      \"command\": {\n        \"argv\": [\n          \"/Users/aazhiry1/.opencode/bin/opencode\",\n          \"serve\",\n          \"--help\"\n        ],\n        \"cwd\": \"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning\",\n        \"exit_code\": 0,\n        \"returncode\": 0,\n        \"elapsed_s\": 0.0455,\n        \"stdout\": \"DESCRIPTION\\n  Start the v2 API and web server\\n\\nUSAGE\\n  opencode serve [flags]\\n\\nFLAGS\\n  --hostname string    \\n  --port integer       \\n  --cors string        Additional allowed CORS origin (repeat for multiple origins)\\n  --service            \\n  --stdio              \\n\\nGLOBAL FLAGS\\n  --help, -h                                                          Show help information\\n  --version, -v                                                       Show version information\\n  --wizard                                                            Start wizard mode for a command\\n  --completions <bash|zsh|fish|sh>                                    Print shell completion script (choices: bash, zsh, fish, sh)\\n  --log-level <all|trace|debug|info|warn|warning|error|fatal|none>    Sets the minimum log level (choices: all, trace, debug, info, warn, warning, error, fatal, none)\\n  --print-logs                                                        Print logs to stderr (server logs require --standalone)\\n\",\n        \"stderr\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"status\": \"OBSERVED_PASS\",\n      \"temp_removed\": true,\n      \"kind\": \"command\",\n      \"ref\": \"Read-only opencode serve --help; analyst [F-30] and [F-17]..[F-22]\",\n      \"claim\": \"--stdio exists but help exposes no message/framing schema. [F-30] confirms internal child opencode serve --stdio --port0 under run, not public external client contract. Available evidence has no public OpenAPI v2.1.2 schema for stdio IPC; do not infer incompatibility from the flag. HTTP/SSE surface and true reasoning deltas verified in [F-17]..[F-22]. No new serve process/DB/prompt probe used.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"risk_triggers\": [\n    \"auth\",\n    \"security\",\n    \"trust-boundary\"\n  ],\n  \"assumptions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ASM-001\",\n      \"class\": \"continuable\",\n      \"source_open_ids\": \"OPEN-06/08\",\n      \"statement\": \"OPENCODE_DB=:memory: with standard XDG_DATA_HOME preserves auth input and avoids shared DB opening: EVD-071 provider-free120.7ms/156.8MiB/0.db. Actual6parallel RSS/valid provider auth/locks not proven; H3 required. Design combined serve/helper/lsof192MiB per active slot remains estimate, observation<=256MiB is not peak.\",\n      \"status\": \"ASSUMED\",\n      \"evidence_ids\": [\n        \"EVD-015\",\n        \"EVD-020\",\n        \"EVD-026\",\n        \"EVD-071\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ASM-002\",\n      \"class\": \"continuable\",\n      \"source_open_ids\": \"OPEN-09/11\",\n      \"statement\": \"TTFT first actual reasoning<=3s и pause goal15s — operational goals, не hard deterministic unit guarantee; watchdog default20/60/60 и status<=1s заданы текущим брифом.\",\n      \"status\": \"ASSUMED\",\n      \"evidence_ids\": [\n        \"EVD-019\",\n        \"EVD-060\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ASM-003\",\n      \"class\": \"continuable\",\n      \"source_open_ids\": \"OPEN-12/13/14\",\n      \"statement\": \"Статусы [мост] разрешены текущим брифом с grace; model bytes не меняем, retries без reasoning dedup. Design follows explicit role/rework brief, not independently validated owner decision or executed runtime acceptance. No claim of owner confirmation; verify at Stage3/H gates. Фичефлаг не требует human exception: кодовый default=false, runtime JSON=true только H7 после H3/H6, атомарный false/file removal/disable-file откат. Это архитектурный контракт, runtime NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"status\": \"ASSUMED\",\n      \"evidence_ids\": [\n        \"EVD-060\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ASM-004\",\n      \"class\": \"continuable\",\n      \"source_open_ids\": \"OPEN-02/04\",\n      \"statement\": \"Три baseline tests входят в Stage3 текущего брифа: expected spawns/finish/tool_calls согласовать cap3 и fresh per-test resilience. Design follows explicit role/rework brief, not independently validated owner decision or executed runtime acceptance. No claim of owner confirmation; verify at Stage3/H gates.\",\n      \"status\": \"ASSUMED\",\n      \"evidence_ids\": [\n        \"EVD-047\",\n        \"EVD-048\",\n        \"EVD-060\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ASM-005\",\n      \"class\": \"continuable\",\n      \"source_open_ids\": \"OPEN-07\",\n      \"statement\": \"Default ask_reject и optional env=deny проверяются FakeServe; живую совместимость обеих safe policies с Zen и no-file mutation доказывает H6. Автопереключения политик нет; отсутствие safe endpoint или401/403 fail-closed.\",\n      \"status\": \"ASSUMED\",\n      \"evidence_ids\": [\n        \"EVD-022\",\n        \"EVD-050\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ASM-006\",\n      \"class\": \"continuable\",\n      \"source_open_ids\": \"OPEN-05/16\",\n      \"statement\": \"Неподтверждённые direct Zen HTTP/другие run форматы не нужны выбранному A1/C, не утверждать их невозможность.\",\n      \"status\": \"VALIDATED\",\n      \"evidence_ids\": [\n        \"EVD-024\",\n        \"EVD-025\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ASM-007\",\n      \"class\": \"continuable\",\n      \"source_open_ids\": \"OPEN-17\",\n      \"statement\": \"Реальная deploy identity и DSH live acceptance — отдельный rollout шаг после clean-room, не требование доступа к ~/.dsh в VER.\",\n      \"status\": \"ASSUMED\",\n      \"evidence_ids\": [\n        \"EVD-034\",\n        \"EVD-058\",\n        \"EVD-059\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"drivers\": [\n    \"RC-1: run CLI буферизует reasoning до ended (F-17/F-18)\",\n    \"RC-2: многоэтапные deadline и очистка вместо 780–856 с тишины\",\n    \"RC-3: DSH видимость по непустому reasoning_content и завершённому абзацу\",\n    \"REQ-002/003: стабильный OpenAI контракт и 17 legacy test modules\",\n    \"REQ-012/013/015: запрет built-ins, per-spawn proxy env rotation (не доказанная Zen IP ротация), безопасные secrets/loopback ownership\"\n  ],\n  \"verification_surface\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"VER-001\",\n      \"requirement_ids\": [\n        \"REQ-001\",\n        \"REQ-002\",\n        \"REQ-003\",\n        \"REQ-005\",\n        \"REQ-009\",\n        \"REQ-010\",\n        \"REQ-011\",\n        \"REQ-013\",\n        \"REQ-014\",\n        \"REQ-017\",\n        \"REQ-018\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"command\",\n      \"command\": \"cd bridges/opencode-zen-bridge && uvx pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tests/\",\n      \"expected\": \"exit 0; 0 failed во всех существующих 17 модулях + dedicated suite; 3 baseline tests исправлены, production cap=3\",\n      \"environment\": \"Чистый clone/worktree, cwd=repo_root (кроме явного cd), Python>=3.11, uvx с pytest; ruff=0.17.2/basedpyright=1.40.2 для frozen strict VER-004. Изолированный verifier runner не монтирует home владельца/его ~/.dsh; live-only optional root tests skip. Без изменения HOME в пользовательской сессии, без обращений к production, сети Zen и без rollout. Temp fake CLI/HTTP/workdir создаёт runner в своём sandbox.\",\n      \"owner\": \"verifier\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"VER-002\",\n      \"requirement_ids\": [\n        \"REQ-002\",\n        \"REQ-003\",\n        \"REQ-011\",\n        \"REQ-017\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"command\",\n      \"command\": \"cd bridges/opencode-zen-bridge && python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -p \\\"test_*.py\\\"\",\n      \"expected\": \"exit 0; 0 failures/errors, запуск из bridge cwd (не из repo root), все новые tests используют unittest.TestCase или stdlib-compatible helper\",\n      \"environment\": \"Чистый clone/worktree, cwd=repo_root (кроме явного cd), Python>=3.11, uvx с pytest; ruff=0.17.2/basedpyright=1.40.2 для frozen strict VER-004. Изолированный verifier runner не монтирует home владельца/его ~/.dsh; live-only optional root tests skip. Без изменения HOME в пользовательской сессии, без обращений к production, сети Zen и без rollout. Temp fake CLI/HTTP/workdir создаёт runner в своём sandbox.\",\n      \"owner\": \"verifier\",\n      \"baseline\": {\n        \"evidence_id\": \"EVD-070\",\n        \"cwd\": \"bridges/opencode-zen-bridge\",\n        \"tests\": 378,\n        \"elapsed_s\": 122.956,\n        \"import_errors\": 0,\n        \"failures\": 3,\n        \"status\": \"BASELINE_RED; target full green after allowed3test fixes\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"VER-003\",\n      \"requirement_ids\": [\n        \"REQ-002\",\n        \"REQ-018\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"command\",\n      \"command\": \"PYTHONPATH=. uvx pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tests/\",\n      \"expected\": \"exit 0; root cross-bridge regression без живых owner ресурсов; environment-specific skips разрешены только унаследованные\",\n      \"environment\": \"Чистый clone/worktree, cwd=repo_root (кроме явного cd), Python>=3.11, uvx с pytest; ruff=0.17.2/basedpyright=1.40.2 для frozen strict VER-004. Изолированный verifier runner не монтирует home владельца/его ~/.dsh; live-only optional root tests skip. Без изменения HOME в пользовательской сессии, без обращений к production, сети Zen и без rollout. Temp fake CLI/HTTP/workdir создаёт runner в своём sandbox.\",\n      \"owner\": \"verifier\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"VER-004\",\n      \"requirement_ids\": [\n        \"REQ-001\",\n        \"REQ-002\",\n        \"REQ-017\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"command\",\n      \"command\": \"python3 - <<'VER004'\\nimport ast, collections, hashlib, json, re, subprocess, tempfile\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nroot = Path.cwd().resolve()\\nbridge = root / 'bridges/opencode-zen-bridge'\\nfiles = [bridge/'server.py', bridge/'tests/test_step_interruption.py', bridge/'tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py']\\nassert all(f.is_file() for f in files), 'all three target files must exist after Stage3'\\nruff = ['uvx','--from','ruff==0.17.2','ruff']\\ndef run(args, **kw):\\n    return subprocess.run(args, check=True, **kw)\\ndef changed_ranges(file):\\n    rel = str(file.relative_to(root))\\n    diff = subprocess.check_output(['git','diff','--no-ext-diff','--no-color','-U0','origin/dev','--',rel], cwd=root, text=True)\\n    # NEW tracked files must be added before final verification; --no-index alternative below covers untracked newfile.\\n    result = []\\n    for line in diff.splitlines():\\n        m = re.match(r'^@@ -\\\\d+(?:,\\\\d+)? \\\\+(\\\\d+)(?:,(\\\\d+))? @@', line)\\n        if m:\\n            start = int(m.group(1)); count = int(m.group(2) or '1')\\n            if count: result.append((start, start + count - 1))\\n    return result\\n\\n# Raw-byte contract: frozen expected digests originate in EVD-075, never candidate.\\nFROZEN = {\\n    '_run_env': '1c51b28fcb83fcc0f4d8b5204c858e11ab5ac975bfe40dca4a0bf61978008e31',\\n    '_stream_google_sse': '5914c9654c7345692dd55e84cfd3765e27406f63a3df85df30bc798bc1778de3',\\n    '_execute_google_once': '88d794cc42be4878e8ab35b00e4668c427929db2dfd0f2bb4b717a63fd0c70d6',\\n}\\nbaseline_raw = subprocess.check_output(['git','show','origin/dev:bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py'], cwd=root)\\ndef frozen_slices(raw):\\n    lines = raw.splitlines(keepends=True)\\n    nodes = {n.name:n for n in ast.walk(ast.parse(raw)) if isinstance(n,(ast.FunctionDef,ast.AsyncFunctionDef)) and n.name in FROZEN}\\n    assert set(nodes)==set(FROZEN)\\n    return {name:(node.lineno,node.end_lineno,b''.join(lines[node.lineno-1:node.end_lineno])) for name,node in nodes.items()}\\nbaseline_slices = frozen_slices(baseline_raw)\\ndef assert_frozen(candidate=files[0]):\\n    candidate_slices = frozen_slices(candidate.read_bytes())\\n    for name, expected in FROZEN.items():\\n        assert hashlib.sha256(baseline_slices[name][2]).hexdigest()==expected, ('frozen origin/dev changed',name)\\n        assert hashlib.sha256(candidate_slices[name][2]).hexdigest()==expected, ('immutable slice changed',name)\\n        assert candidate_slices[name][2]==baseline_slices[name][2], ('nonzero raw Google/_run_env diff',name)\\n    return candidate_slices\\ncandidate_slices = assert_frozen()\\nserver_diff = subprocess.check_output(['git','diff','--no-ext-diff','--no-color','-U0','origin/dev','--',str(files[0].relative_to(root))],cwd=root,text=True)\\nfor line in server_diff.splitlines():\\n    match = re.match(r'^@@ -(\\\\d+)(?:,(\\\\d+))? \\\\+(\\\\d+)(?:,(\\\\d+))? @@',line)\\n    if not match: continue\\n    old_start,old_count,new_start,new_count = int(match[1]),int(match[2] or '1'),int(match[3]),int(match[4] or '1')\\n    for start,count,table in [(old_start,old_count,baseline_slices),(new_start,new_count,candidate_slices)]:\\n        for name,(lo,hi,_) in table.items():\\n            # Zero-count insert/delete anchors represent the boundary after start.\\n            overlaps = (start<=hi and start+count-1>=lo) if count else (lo<=start<hi)\\n            assert not overlaps, ('VER-004 frozen-range hunk intersection',name,line)\\n# Public module constant/read API remains intact; compatibility test file is frozen.\\ntree = ast.parse(files[0].read_bytes())\\nassignments = [n for n in tree.body if isinstance(n,ast.Assign) and any(isinstance(t,ast.Name) and t.id=='CATALOG_SOURCE' for t in n.targets)]\\nassert len(assignments)==1 and isinstance(assignments[0].value,ast.Constant) and assignments[0].value.value=='static'\\nassert any(isinstance(n,ast.FunctionDef) and n.name=='_set_catalog_source' for n in tree.body)\\nassert any(isinstance(n,ast.Import) and any(a.name=='zen_catalog' and a.asname=='zc' for a in n.names) for n in tree.body)\\nassert not any(isinstance(n,ast.Call) and isinstance(n.func,ast.Attribute) and n.func.attr=='import_module' and n.args and isinstance(n.args[0],ast.Constant) and n.args[0].value=='zen_catalog' for n in ast.walk(tree))\\nassert any(isinstance(n,ast.FunctionDef) and n.name=='_run_serve_helper_cli' for n in tree.body), 'helper code must be lint/type checked in server.py'\\nassert '--serve-helper' in files[0].read_text(), 'typed CLI dispatch required before main()'\\nassert not any(isinstance(n,ast.Global) and 'CATALOG_SOURCE' in n.names for n in ast.walk(tree))\\nrun(['git','diff','--exit-code','origin/dev','--','bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_catalog_mode.py'],cwd=root)\\n\\nranges = {f: changed_ranges(f) for f in files[:2]}\\n# New file checked as a whole even before git add. Range gate never formats frozen legacy slices.\\nrun([*ruff,'format','--check','--no-cache',str(files[2])], cwd=root)\\nfor f in files[:2]:\\n    for start, end in ranges[f]:\\n        run([*ruff,'format','--check','--no-cache',f'--range={start}:1-{end}:999',str(f)], cwd=root)\\nassert_frozen()\\n# Exercise actual write-mode range formatting only on a disposable copy.\\nwith tempfile.TemporaryDirectory(prefix='zen-arch5-probe-format-', dir='/tmp') as format_dir:\\n    formatted_copy = Path(format_dir) / 'server.py'\\n    formatted_copy.write_bytes(files[0].read_bytes())\\n    for start, end in ranges[files[0]]:\\n        run([*ruff,'format','--no-cache',f'--range={start}:1-{end}:999',str(formatted_copy)], cwd=root)\\n    assert_frozen(formatted_copy)\\n    print('PASS write-mode frozen hashes', {name:hashlib.sha256(data[2]).hexdigest() for name,data in frozen_slices(formatted_copy.read_bytes()).items()})\\n# Full-file lint on all three. Only inherited E402 import site is excepted on server.\\nlint = subprocess.run([*ruff,'check','--no-cache','--output-format','json',str(files[0])], cwd=root, capture_output=True, text=True)\\nassert lint.returncode in (0,1), lint.stderr\\nfindings = json.loads(lint.stdout)\\nlines = files[0].read_text().splitlines()\\nassert all(x['code']=='E402' and lines[x['location']['row']-1].strip()=='import zen_catalog as zc' for x in findings), findings\\nassert sum(x['code']=='E402' for x in findings) <= 1\\nrun([*ruff,'check','--no-cache','--extend-ignore','E402',str(files[0])], cwd=root)\\nrun([*ruff,'check','--no-cache',str(files[1]),str(files[2])], cwd=root)\\n# Exact isolated import-root. No repo pyrightconfig mutation; JSON deleted on every exit.\\nproject = None\\ntry:\\n    with tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile(mode='w',suffix='.json',prefix='zen-ver004-',dir='/tmp',delete=False) as tmp:\\n        project = Path(tmp.name)\\n        json.dump({'include':[str(f) for f in files], 'extraPaths':[str(bridge.resolve())]},tmp)\\n    b = subprocess.run(['uvx','--from','basedpyright==1.40.2','basedpyright','--project',str(project),'--outputjson'], cwd=bridge, capture_output=True, text=True)\\n    assert b.returncode in (0,1), b.stderr\\n    report = json.loads(b.stdout)\\n    ds = report['generalDiagnostics']\\n    assert report['summary']['errorCount']==0 and not [x for x in ds if x['severity']=='error'], ds\\n    byfile = {f: [x for x in ds if Path(x['file']).resolve()==f] for f in files}\\n    limits = {'reportExplicitAny':125,'reportAny':125,'reportUnusedCallResult':39,'reportUnknownMemberType':94,'reportUnknownVariableType':72,'reportUnknownArgumentType':55,'reportUnusedFunction':6,'reportImplicitStringConcatenation':35,'reportUnannotatedClassAttribute':105,'reportUnusedParameter':7,'reportUnnecessaryIsInstance':11,'reportUnknownParameterType':6,'reportMissingParameterType':4,'reportUnreachable':5,'reportImplicitOverride':3}\\n    warnings = lambda f: [x for x in byfile[f] if x['severity']=='warning']\\n    counts = collections.Counter(x.get('rule','') for x in warnings(files[0]))\\n    print('BASEDPYRIGHT summary',report['summary'])\\n    print('SERVER dict(counts)',dict(counts))\\n    print('SERVER warningCount',len(warnings(files[0])))\\n    assert all(n<=limits.get(rule,0) for rule,n in counts.items()), dict(counts)\\n    assert len(warnings(files[0]))<=720, len(warnings(files[0]))\\n    assert len(warnings(files[1]))<=194, len(warnings(files[1]))\\n    # New test file: zero warnings as well as zero errors, thus zero Any.\\n    assert not byfile[files[2]], byfile[files[2]]\\n    for f in files[:2]:\\n        for x in byfile[f]:\\n            line = x['range']['start']['line']+1\\n            if any(lo<=line<=hi for lo,hi in ranges[f]):\\n                assert x.get('rule') not in {'reportAny','reportExplicitAny','reportUnusedCallResult'}, x\\n    # Do not introduce Any annotations/type ignores in added code in either legacy file.\\n    for f in files[:2]:\\n        src = f.read_text().splitlines()\\n        for lo,hi in ranges[f]:\\n            for line in src[lo-1:hi]:\\n                assert not re.search(r'\\\\bAny\\\\b|type:\\\\s*ignore|pyright:\\\\s*ignore|#\\\\s*noqa|#\\\\s*fmt:\\\\s*off',line), (f,line)\\n    run(['python3','-B','-m','unittest','tests.test_catalog_mode','-v'],cwd=bridge)\\n    print('PASS VER-004: all3 lint/type; legacy changed-range format; newfile whole format; server counts',dict(counts))\\nfinally:\\n    if project is not None: project.unlink(missing_ok=True)\\nVER004\",\n      \"expected\": \"exit0 after Stage3 all3. Ruff==0.17.2 newfile whole format and legacy closed --range={start}:1-{end}:999 --check only on candidate; then actual ruff format --no-cache --range={start}:1-{end}:999 for every changed server hunk on tempfile.TemporaryDirectory copy and assert_frozen(formatted_copy). Reject old/new hunks overlapping any frozen function (including zero-count interior insert/delete anchors); literal three raw SHA-256 and zero-byte difference to origin/dev before and after. Expanded-range mutation into any frozen function MUST FAIL literal hash guard (EVD-075). Static import zen_catalog as zc at original server.py:67 retained as sole inherited E402. CATALOG_SOURCE = \\\"static\\\", typed _set_catalog_source(source: str) -> None uses globals()[\\\"CATALOG_SOURCE\\\"], two explicit proc is not None guards before .returncode; full in-module typed helper CLI --serve-helper dispatch before main/HTTP and after imports, no inline source/new module/new E402. All3 full lint/type, errorCount0, printed dict(counts), all(n<=limits.get(rule,0)) with reportAny<=125, existing other/total ceilings unchanged; changed ranges no reportAny/reportExplicitAny/reportUnusedCallResult or new Any/ignores. Catalog8/8 unchanged. EVD-076 server-only:564warnings/errors0/reportAny125; EVD-077 full exact block on local typed CLI skeleton+synthetic newfile observed exit0 (all3warnings726=564+162+0). Future actual Stage3 tests/code/VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; no evidence inflation.\",\n      \"environment\": \"Чистый clone/worktree, cwd=repo_root (кроме явного cd), Python>=3.11, uvx с pytest; ruff=0.17.2/basedpyright=1.40.2 для frozen strict VER-004. Изолированный verifier runner не монтирует home владельца/его ~/.dsh; live-o