Step2. This does not relabel source title optional. Missing/invalid id or sessionID ->immediate fail-closed(no foreign cancel); cancel failure/control disconnect ->immediate fail-closed; parent finally killpg(child_pgid) completes<=1.2s, no watchdog wait. Valid foreign nested sessionID ignored with0foreigncontrol. form.cancelled.data.id/sessionID settles only same owned form; not model token or first-event. FU-004: Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), ...]; start_new_session=True, child_pgid=helper_proc.pid. CLI dispatcher is inside if __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\": after existing import zen_catalog as zc and before main()/HTTP startup; all typed _run_serve_helper_cli(...) code resides directly in server.py, checked by Ruff/basedpyright with zero new Any/E402. No inline -c source, no new helper module. --serve-helper <attempt_id> follows script path at the front of ps argv, before port/other parameters; reaper verifies exact script realpath, argv position, full untruncated ps -ww command, attempt_id, UID/PID/lstart/PGID and manifest. Never put password or prompt in argv.\",\n      \"environment\": \"Чистый clone/worktree, cwd=repo_root (кроме явного cd), Python>=3.11, uvx с pytest; ruff=0.17.2/basedpyright=1.40.2 для frozen strict VER-004. Изолированный verifier runner не монтирует home владельца/его ~/.dsh; live-only optional root tests skip. Без изменения HOME в пользовательской сессии, без обращений к production, сети Zen и без rollout. Temp fake CLI/HTTP/workdir создаёт runner в своём sandbox.\",\n      \"owner\": \"verifier\",\n      \"groups\": {\n        \"A\": {\n          \"name\": \"RC-2/RC-3 watchdog & killpg\",\n          \"stage\": \"3a\",\n          \"test_class\": \"TestLegacyWatchdogAndKillpg\",\n          \"command\": \"cd bridges/opencode-zen-bridge && python3 -m unittest tests.test_realtime_reasoning.TestLegacyWatchdogAndKillpg -v\",\n          \"dependencies\": \"Fak