y: on ALL3 branches, standard XDG_DATA_HOME/auth/model config retained; finally remove owned root+lease;50cancels + hard-parent-kill→helper/reaper restore0old processes/temp, foreign objects untouched.\",\n      \"VER-005 GroupB inject parent SIGKILL (1) immediately after helper Popen before helper entry/lease, (2) immediately after serve Popen before serve_pid publication, (3) after atomic lease before handshake, (4) after handshake before lsof/READY, (5) during prompt. Same helper→serve group; EOF never lost, helper watcher active before READY. Include TERM-ignoring descendant and terminal_quiescence order (all writers stopped ->owned root removal ->lease unlink ->final same-group KILL; no imagined helper finally after self-KILL). Assert listener_pid==serve_pid and pgid==child_pgid,0 owned helper/serve/descendants/lease/temp roots,0 foreign signals/deletions including PID/PGID reuse. Separately kill/disable helper, restart bridge with retained lease ->safe startup reaper; this is recovery scenario, not immediate EOF success.50 normal cancellation cycles return all counters/FD/thread/pipe counts to0; lifeline_w closed every exit. Stage3/H0/H9 remain NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"Entire normal Keep-Alive path(permission/form/reply/interrupt/DELETE),including50controls:exactly1 lsof/successful spawn and1retained control TCP. Separate explicit control-socket reconnect scenario permits only2nd lsof<=0.35s outside reply0.25s/cleanupAPI0.20s; spies distinguish the scenarios; urgent control disconnect is fail-closed,never lsof wait.3forced lsof timeouts ->3ServeHealth failures->DEGRADED,nextauto has0serve/helper/lsof Popen. Check listener_pid==serve_pid and pgid==helper_proc.pid; count lifeline2ends during setup/one parent end thereafter,all0afterfinally; parentFD<=128,allprocess344design,55admittedthreads,19systemprocesspeak; probes1/slot. H3 measures actual RSS/FD/thread/ports and rejects excess without raising limits.\"\n    ],\n    \"tools_matrix\": [\n      \"every split point and single-char deltas for both tags, JSON embedded close strings/code quoting existing fixtures\",\n      \"stream content before open tag visible immediately, pending genuine prefix<=12 plus inherited code-context lookahead\",\n      \"unparsed/open genuine blocks stripped by existing wrapper, no raw tool tags in SSE content\",\n      \"native call lifecycle normalized/dedup per call-id, mapped/unmapped behavior identical; no auto allow\",\n      \"step.ended tokens input/output/cached/reasoning counted once then tool finish, no followup synthetic step\",\n      \"early legacy error may recover; late transient/fatal error and incomplete recovery same on fake v2\",\n      \"existing reasoning_interrupted and interrupted cleanup across delta boundaries\",\n      \"permission.asked {data.id,sessionID,action,resources,source} ->POST reply {decision:reject},status204; both ask_reject/deny modes; POST prompt may stayblocked while reject executes on separate control socket; never once/always/allow.\",\n      \"Frozen wire tokens.cache.read/write ->canonical tokens{input,output,cached=cache.read,reasoning}; mutate delta path/cache envelope/permission lifecycle ->independent oracle fail, step assistantMessageID dedup, not invented wire stepID.\",\n      \"Actual input.started(name), input.delta, input.ended(text), called(input,executed), progress(metadata), success/failed. Correlate data.sessionID+assistantMessageID+id; accumulate tool name/input, normalize tool_use part{tool,state{input,status}}+call_id. permission.asked отправляет decision=reject немедленно по отдельному control lane. Никакого встроенного allow или выполнения bridge-side. On input.ended save $.data.text and parse JSON as object with runtime validation. Prefer called.data.input if present and valid; if called absent before failed/step.ended use completed input.ended.text, including streaming→failed. Never emit partial JSON; dedup by sessionID/assistantMessageID/call id. Both paths give identical mapped DSH tool_calls. Invalid JSON follows existing incomplete/unmapped recovery, not invented empty args.\",\n      \"For form.created first inspect nested data.form object: if data.form.sessionID==active_session_id and data.form.id is a nonempty string, latch single-turn/Step2 barrier and IMMEDIATELY send POST /api/session/{id}/form/{formID}/cancel on retained control lane<=0.25s, then interrupt<=0.10s, BEFORE validating title/fields/metadata or emitting invalid_serve_event. EVD-073 source Form.Info requires id,sessionID,title,fields (only root metadata optional; field-level title/required optional). Missing root title is a schema discrepancy but safety cancel is authoritative: successful cancel+interrupt completes normal cancelled attempt with ServeHealth+0/UpstreamBreaker+0, no watchdog60s wait and no Step2. This does not relabel source title optional. Missing/invalid id or sessionID ->immediate fail-closed(no foreign cancel); cancel failure/control disconnect ->immediate fail-closed; parent finally killpg(child_pgid) completes<=1.2s, no watchdog wait. Valid foreign nested sessionID ignored with0foreigncontrol. form.cancelled.data.id/sessionID settles only same owned form; not model token or first-event.\",\n      \"permission reject and form cancel MUST immediately interrupt; Step2 output0 even if emitted concurrently, completed input.ended JSON tool mapping same as called.input. Cancel/reject failure fail-closed.\",\n      \"Env secret-sentinel matrix standalone/opencode-go/base_url/static;0parent API_KEY/TOKEN/SECRET/arbitrary env, required config/models/auth preserved.\"\n    ],\n    \"baseline_matrix\": [\n      \"two original budget fixtures:3 spawns, no fourth tool result, stop; separate fixture unmapped->incomplete->calls within3 proves counter separation\",\n      \"fresh _Resilience/_RetryBudget per test, reverse fixed ordering plus isolated/full runner\",\n      \"all17 existing modules untouched except the3 acknowledged assertions/isolation in test_step_interruption; no Google changes\",\n      \"AC-026 / VER-005 / Clean-Room L2: tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py создаёт tmp_path / \\\"dynamic_config.json\\\" с {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":true}; monkeypatch.setattr(server, \\\"DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH\\\", cfg_path, raising=False). При переносе только этого testfile на непропатченный origin/dev нет AttributeError: реально POST /v1/chat/completions, RED именно на поведенческих realtime chunk intervals (чтение socket до upstream release), GREEN на новом коде. Та же Server instance: атомарно false в cfg_path ->следующий запрос run без restart; true ->serve при test eligibility override/native, deletion/invalid JSON/nonbool/unreadable ->false; unchanged (st_mtime_ns,st_size) ->нет reopen. Новый cfg stat key для переключения обеспечивается и проверяется тестом, без sleep-предположений. Existing378 tests не создают JSON и остаются run. Runtime результаты NOT_RUN.\"\n    ],\n    \"resilience_matrix\": [\n      \"46 exact HL canonical keys+sources and memory inequality\",\n      \"21 stop-code oracles + T-LIFE/O-EXIT/M-SEM, each N/A has actual diff + transitive AST proof\",\n      \"new process/socket resource manager singleton and bounded lease count, 50 control keepalive operations1 connection per lease\",\n      \"RPS token bucket/cancel/full jitter/retry budget/breaker HALF_OPEN1 via FakeClock/RNG\",\n      \"wire event JSON decode allowed; config decode/re.compile/reparse-full-history on per-delta hot path forbidden\",\n      \"HALF_OPEN active probe held across reset_s boundary: zero second probes until owner cleanup; common _SlotBulkhead code-default M2/waiters4 and deploy M6/waiters12, no second uncounted ingress queue.\",\n      \"Combined gate+limiter5,ready3,create+subscribe2,cleanup1.2;15+3*(5+3+2+1.2)+3=51.6<=54,headroom2.4; slowcreate->one preheader run; afterheader/event->no run; no fourthPopen.\",\n      \"_ServeHealth force5protocol failures ->zero model breakerfail; auto3failures->next run untilTTL120, expiry oneprobe, successful terminalreset, protocolfailrearm; binarymtime+size change invalidates capability; real provider5 failures modelbreakerOPEN.\",\n      \"Memory SSoT fields2048/256/1152 MiB exactly; design1408<=1638.4 not H3PASS.3HTTP sockets per serve supports immediate reject while promptHTTP pending; recalc nodeports246<=8192.\",\n      \"Admitted parent55=1+18+6+6+6+12+6; steadyFD108+transient6lifeline_r=114<=128;19process peak includes6helper+6serve+6lsof/ps probes (one/slot),RSS per-slot~176.8<=192/full1408<=1638.4MiB design. lifeline_w finally closed,live H3 must measure rejection/transient and loaded RSS.\",\n      \"All phase×event actions and two health counter effects match fallback_decision_table; changedmtime+same used-schema projection->serve, mismatch->run+diagnostic;permission capability gap fail-closed.\",\n      \"Normal p99<=180 goal measured separately; three60s firsttoken faultprofile+aux51.6<=231.6,>=100sample batch nearest-rank criterion. Universal TIMEOUT1800 unchanged.\",\n      \"first_token_timeout proven non-security protocol/capability defect ->ServeHealth+1,UpstreamBreaker0; valid protocol/model silence ->ServeHealth0,UpstreamBreaker+1; exactly one increment once/cause; unchanged delivery barrier/cap3.\"\n    ],\n    \"rollout_boundary\": \"Все H0..H9 NOT_RUN, external a5/r9 ACCEPT+panel proof и независимые VER gates обязательны; Architect не выполняет rollout. H0 BLOCKING до sync/restart: проверить текущий env не force serve/true, отсутствие production dynamic_config.json либо boolean false; при прежнем enabled состоянии атомарно записать false, проверить read-back; дополнительный disable-serve разрешён. Снять старые PID/start/lease identity. H4 sync/read-back server.py hash; H5 launchctl kickstart с config absent/false: сразу dark run без окна serve; startup reaper0 старых собственных serve/helper/temp roots, чужие процессы untouched. На отдельном кандидате test-local dynamic_config.json=true и отдельный disable-file path: provider-free info/active, H3 реальные6parallel RSS/FD+OPENCODE_DB=:memory:, H6 live permission/tool isolation, Stage3a/A затем3b/B. На production до H7 run. H7 ТОЛЬКО после PASS H3 и H6: при env auto без explicit false и закрытом TTL подготовить tempfile в ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/,0600, записать {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":true}, os.replace в dynamic_config.json; убедиться дополнительный disable-serve отсутствует. Следующий native auto запрос на :9883 использует serve без правки start.sh и без повторного рестарта LaunchAgent. H8 повторяет живые проверки рабочего чата, H9 проверяет runtime false/true и disable-file same PID, отдельно kickstart-k crash recovery. Никакой выдачи design/NOT_RUN за runtime PASS. H4 uses ONLY cp bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py, then SHA-256 read-back. Never rsync --delete or directory sync. Preserve live dynamic_config.json and disable-serve byte-for-byte (or their recorded absence) from H0 snapshot AFTER any intentional H0 false-write; H0/H4 read back existence/bytes/mode after cp. H5 restarts only after that preservation check; no copy/delete/overwrite of either runtime file. Default=false and true only H7 after H3/H6, no new owner waiver required.\"\n  },\n  \"semantic_checks\": {\n    \"canonical_hl_field_set\": \"46/46 exact key equality and field_sources/field_units equality against team architecture.md §3.0\",\n    \"stop_codes\": \"21 main codes + T-LIFE/O-EXIT/M-SEM=24 unique\",\n    \"legacy_antipatterns\": \"21 exact keys from approved reference schema\",\n    \"verification_owner\": \"5/5 owner=verifier\",\n    \"decisions\": \"4/4 two-way with >=2 genuine alternatives\",\n    \"evidence_refs\": \"73 EVD records,49 analyst facts; EVD-075 real4021line closed/write/hash negatives;076 server564warnings/reportAny125/errors0;077 full exact local blockrc0/catalog8/8;078 readonly help. Synthetic helper/newfile probe is not Stage3/live proof; gap065..069 preserved.\",\n    \"s