RIDGE_FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_STALL_TIMEOUT_S (AD-003). Сам рабочий фичефлаг REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED переключается boolean в dynamic_config.json без новой env для переключения и без правки start.sh/LaunchAgent; кодовый default=false, включение H7 только после H3/H6.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/configuration\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/configuration/feature_flag_context\",\n        \"/decisions/2/details/thresholds/env_classification\",\n        \"/evolution/feature_flag\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-006\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-011\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"frozen_fixture_sha256 over wire/canonical pairs only; separate frozen_fixture_metadata_sha256 over negative_mutations/safety_order. Exact json.dumps UTF8 formulas and observed stability/sensitivity checks.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/frozen_fixture_sha256\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/frozen_fixture_metadata_sha256\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/fixture_digest_serialization\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/fixture_metadata_digest_serialization\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"evidence_refs\": [\n    \"EVD-070\",\n    \"EVD-071\",\n    \"EVD-072\",\n    \"EVD-073\",\n    \"EVD