   \"changes_made\": \"Normal whole Keep-Alive path exactly1lsof/spawn; second proof only separate explicit control reconnect<=0.35s outside fast budgets;spies distinguish;urgent brokencontrol failclosed.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/listener_ownership/protocol\",\n        \"/resilience_gates/C_MULT/C-MULT-I5/oracle\",\n        \"/verification_surface/4/process_resource_oracle/C_MULT_I5\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-006\",\n      \"pass\": \"a3\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; future implementation/live gates NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A3-F-010\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"H4 cp ONLY server.py,never rsync--delete/directory sync;preserve dynamic_config.json and disable-serve bytes/absence/mode;H0/H4 readback,H5 after;H7 true only after H3/H6.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/evolution/rollout\",\n        \"/evolution/H0_precondition\",\n        \"/evolution/H4_H5_sync_contract\",\n        \"/verification_acceptance_matrix/rollout_boundary\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rework_source_a2\": {\n    \"path\": \"handoff/panel-rework-brief-arch-a2.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"baa297e7819579dc1cf779af370b16f385a7ede77d9538553713212b1475dc7f\",\n    \"base_packet_path\": \"architecture/architecture-packet.v2.json\",\n    \"base_packet_sha256\": \"c3936c99b53fc50508c113c88368f0b75b01d250d8345ee3be175c753a8b9a3d\",\n    \"resolutions_count\": 14,\n    \"blocking_count\": 6,\n    \"nonblocking_count\": 8,\n    \"findings_count\": 16,\n    \"namespace\": \"a2 current rework_resolutions alias mirrors rework_resolutions_a2; a1 history in rework_resolutions_a1; IDs are unique within pass, not counted twice through alias.\"\n  },\n  \"rework_source_a3\": {\n    \"path\": \"handoff/panel-rework-brief-arch-a3.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"65d79bf43820da90b77b49e6f90960f0b8b9af985046cafa00ce2da9d10ba14d\",\n    \"base_packet_path\": \"architecture/architecture-packet.v3.json\",\n    \"base_packet_sha256\": \"8edcb4c410579c365f825cdc74d5da7417e9dfaaebce5ac465cb2b103a44b608\",\n    \"resolutions_count\": 9,\n    \"blocking_count\": 3,\n    \"nonblocking_count\": 6,\n    \"findings_count\": 11,\n    \"excluded\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"PANEL-A3-F-009\",\n        \"reason\": \"duplicate_of:PANEL-A3-F-003; absorbed only in RW-003,not independent new work\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"PANEL-A3-F-011\",\n        \"reason\": \"invalid_after_recheck; no implementation or scope expansion\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"namespace\": \"Current alias mirrors rework_resolutions_a3; a1 and a2 retained verbatim as history. Exact3blocking+6followups;2excluded are not new resolutions.\"\n  },\n  \"rework_resolutions_a4\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RW-001\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-001\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Родитель резервирует 127.0.0.1:0 и запускает только helper_proc с argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), ...], start_new_session=True; child_pgid=helper_proc.pid. Helper устанавливает EOF/TERM надзор до spawn, атомарно публикует lease и запускает serve_proc с start_new_session=False в той же группе child_pgid; публикует serve_pid/serve_lstart до handshake/READY. --serve-helper <attempt_id> находится в первых аргументах ps -ww argv. До отправки любых Authorization/пароля или prompt обязательны одновременно listener_pid == serve_pid, os.getpgid(listener_pid) == child_pgid и helper_proc.poll() is None; ровно один lsof с бюджетом <=0.35s внутри общего ready<=3.0s. На mismatch/timeout/неоднозначность 0 байт Authorization/пароля/prompt, fail-closed, retry только внутри исходного ready/cap3 после cleanup. Cleanup os.killpg(child_pgid, SIGTERM→SIGKILL) охватывает подтверждённые собственные helper + serve + потомков, с lifeline/reap/root+lease cleanup по crash_recovery; чужой PID в той же или иной группе получает 0 байт пароля и 0 сигналов чужому PGID. Секреты только sanitized env, без argv/lease/log; no redirects/proxy. Normal Keep-Alive control path не вызывает повторный lsof; отдельный explicit reconnect имеет собственный proof, как listener_ownership.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/threat_model/threats/0\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/spawn\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/listener_ownership\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/cleanup\",\n        \"/verification_surface/4/process_resource_oracle/listener_takeover_negative\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RW-002\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-002\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"For form.created first inspect nested data.form object: if data.form.sessionID==active_session_id and data.form.id is a nonempty string, latch single-turn/Step2 barrier and IMMEDIATELY send POST /api/session/{id}/form/{formID}/cancel on retained control lane<=0.25s, then interrupt<=0.10s, BEFORE validating title/fields/metadata or emitting invalid_serve_event. EVD-073 source Form.Info requires id,sessionID,title,fields (only root metadata optional; field-level title/required optional). Missing root title is a schema discrepancy but safety cancel is authoritative: successful cancel+interrupt completes normal cancelled attempt with ServeHealth+0/UpstreamBreaker+0, no watchdog60s wait and no Step2. This does not relabel source title optional. Missing/invalid id or sessionID ->immediate fail-closed(no foreign cancel); cancel failure/control disconnect ->immediate fail-closed; parent finally killpg(child_pgid) completes<=1.2s, no watchdog wait. Valid foreign nested sessionID ignored with0foreigncontrol. form.cancelled.data.id/sessionID settles only same owned form; not model token or first-event.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/threat_model/threats/1\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/safety_order\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/single_turn_control\",\n        \"/verification_surface/4/process_resource_oracle/form_cancel\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RW-003\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-003\",\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-006\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"EVD-075 now real4021-line source copy; early+pre-_run_env whitespace mutations, closed check1/write0/recheck0, old1:6 controlrc1; 3 literal hashes unchanged and 3 actual expanded-write negative hashes REJECT. No product writes.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/evidence/69\",\n        \"/verification_surface/3/command\",\n        \"/verification_surface/3/expected\",\n        \"/verification_surface/4/immutable_google_slices\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RW-004\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-005\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Static import zen_catalog as zc retained, public CATALOG_SOURCE=\\\"static\\\"+typed globals setter+proc None guards. EVD-076 errors0/serverwarnings564/reportAny125; EVD-077 full exact VER004 local blockrc0/counters/changed ranges/lint/write hashes/catalog8tests. No suppression/budget expansion.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/evidence/70\",\n        \"/evidence/71\",\n        \"/verification_surface/3/baseline_transition/new\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/typing\",\n        \"/risks/7/mitigation\",\n        \"/verification_policy/strict_typing\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-001\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-004\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"approval.rationale refers to a5(r9); APPROVED is internal candidate readiness, not Council PASS/ARCH_GATE_PASS.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/approval/rationale\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-002\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-007\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"VER004 writes closed ranges on TemporaryDirectory candidate copy and assert_frozen(copy); 3 expanded-frozen range mutations reject by literal hashes; no product formatter write.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/verification_surface/3/command\",\n        \"/verification_surface/3/expected\",\n        \"/evidence/69/negative_write_cases\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-003\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-008\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Read-only serve --help confirms stdio; available evidence has no public external IPC schema. [F-30] internal child IPC versus verified [F-17]..[F-22] HTTP/SSE; Option C/A1 retained.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/alternatives/6\",\n        \"/evidence/72\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-004\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-009\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), ...]; start_new_session=True, child_pgid=helper_proc.pid. CLI dispatcher is inside if __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\": after existing import zen_catalog as zc and before main()/HTTP startup; all typed _run_serve_helper_cli(...) code resides directly in server.py, checked by Ruff/basedpyright with zero new Any/E402. No inline -c source, no new helper module. --serve-helper <attempt_id> follows script path at the front of ps argv, before port/other parameters; reaper verifies exact script realpath, argv position, full untruncated ps -ww command, attempt_id, UID/PID/lstart/PGID and manifest. Never put password or prompt in argv.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/spawn\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/crash_recovery\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/resource_accounting/helper_cli_contract\",\n        \"/resilience_gates/T_LIFE_v1/helper_cli_contract\",\n        \"/verification_surface/3/command\",\n        \"/verification_surface/4/process_resource_oracle/topology\",\n        \"/evidence/71\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-005\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-010\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Новые диагностические/override env-переменные этого пакета: OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_TRANSPORT, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_PERMISSION_POLICY, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_DISABLE_FILE и watchdog overrides OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_EVENT_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_STALL_TIMEOUT_S (AD-003). Сам рабочий фичефлаг REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED переключается boolean в dynamic_config.json без новой env для переключения и без правки start.sh/LaunchAgent; кодовый default=false, включение H7 только после H3/H6.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/configuration\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/configuration/feature_flag_context\",\n        \"/decisions/2/details/thresholds/env_classification\",\n        \"/evolution/feature_flag\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-006\",\n      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A4-F-011\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"frozen_fixture_sha256 over wire/canonical pairs only; separate frozen_fixture_metadata_sha256 over negative_mutations/safety_order. Exact json.dumps UTF8 formulas and observed stability/sensitivity checks.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/frozen_fixture_sha256\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/frozen_fixture_metadata_sha256\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/fixture_digest_serialization\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/fixture_metadata_digest_serialization\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\nARTIFACT_END>>>\n<<<ARTIFACT .ai-team/runs/analyst-teamlead-zen-realtime-reasoning-20261025/receipts/arch-gate.json sha256=db12984ad50ac073d333518d26c2a3ceb4e1c2b707c7cbcdebf2d60e9fbde4b1\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"gate\": \"ARCH_GATE\",\n  \"status\": \"PASS\",\n  \"run_id\": \"analyst-teamlead-zen-realtime-reasoning-20261025\",\n  \"criticality\": \"S2\",\n  \"packet_sha256\": \"15ea67e3215ceea9e84b9d79853677f4be86b959e87a21f24830d0c895f62657\",\n  \"verification_surface_sha256\": \"3540a954c8661af794044f118bdff255c83a40ba294a5a6259e8e505cad1f437\",\n  \"protected_paths_sha256\": \"98f7f5f54622baf379b40bad458cf3ef2a1952644fb79fb662ebe11f70659d8b\",\n  \"architect_worktree_sha256\": \"2bcabd4d9c9bdf3d108afbae3344a2b4e7350c7d697355529fc2360d73eb7334\",\n  \"materialized_targets\": 0\n}\nARTIFACT_END>>>\n<<<ARTIFACT .ai-team/runs/analyst-teamlead-zen-realtime-reasoning-20261025/architecture/architecture-packet.v4-to-v5.diff#L1-L55 sha256=660ebfa8b9208e8dad83fdb55e8ece776bf38818d61faa2256e57650f94bcef9\n# Mechanical unified diff (diff -u): Architecture Packet v4 -> v5\n# old_revision: architecture-packet.v4.json sha256=a53012565332cab8140d26d43029b931ff6d6c1fe4c63612310567ecba6812b3\n# new_revision: architecture-packet.json sha256=15ea67e3215ceea9e84b9d79853677f4be86b959e87a21f24830d0c895f62657\n--- architecture-packet.v4.json (sha256=a53012565332cab8140d26d43029b931ff6d6c1fe4c63612310567ecba6812b3)\n+++ architecture-packet.json (v5 sha256=15ea67e3215ceea9e84b9d79853677f4be86b959e87a21f24830d0c895f62657)\n@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@\n   \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n-  \"packet_version\": \"4.0\",\n+  \"packet_version\": \"5.0\",\n   \"task_id\": \"zen-realtime-reasoning\",\n@@ -6,3 +6,3 @@\n   \"preset\": \"a